#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:5 2ffe4c2838a849df84876f391a689921
msgid "ArduPilot Style Guide"
msgstr "ArduPilot 代码风格指南"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:7 ecdec5f45dd34dc5a6a7b8b5cf8b9968
msgid ""
"In order to improve the readability of the ArduPilot code, and help new "
"users pick up the code more quickly, please use the following styles. Code "
"submitted may be rejected if these styles are not followed."
msgstr "为提高 ArduPilot 代码的可读性，并帮助新用户更快上手，请遵循以下代码风格。不符合这些风格的代码提交可能被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:12 46fdc617bb6f4ea4916d08f6625b6ccc
msgid ""
"Some parts of the code may not conform due to historic reasons but new "
"additions should!"
msgstr "部分历史代码可能不符合规范，但新增代码必须遵守！"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:15 75e26a239ae04837993930da151f4712
msgid ""
"*astyle* is our tool of choice for formatting the code.  Whilst we aren't "
"doing it automatically at the moment in the Tools/CodeStyle directory there "
"is an astylerc file that can be used to format the code automatically "
"according to the guidelines below."
msgstr ""
"*astyle* 是我们首选的代码格式化工具。尽管目前尚未实现自动化，但在 Tools/CodeStyle 目录下有一个 astylerc "
"文件，可用于按照以下指南自动格式化代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:24 a1d1e57bd41c49e8954745abddc8a0d3
msgid ""
"Remember any formatting changes to a file should be done as a separate "
"commit."
msgstr "请记住，对文件的任何格式变更都应作为独立提交。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:28 b105588b06e64ff4a820d81d9046561a
msgid "Case"
msgstr "大小写"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:30 f60610a0662d4959997f09355d880f8c
msgid ""
"Variables and function names are lower case with words separated by an "
"underscore."
msgstr "变量和函数名使用小写字母，单词之间用下划线分隔。"

