#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:46 c907313fa37144d5a7f56d986d725809
msgid "Indentation"
msgstr "缩进"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:49 d515ed12e577439fbd6972bf68258d4f
msgid "Spaces"
msgstr "空格"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:51 3fb6575809614e4bb0005222c91cb3a2
msgid "Indent using 4 spaces everywhere. Do not use tabs."
msgstr "全部使用 4 个空格缩进，不要使用制表符。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:72 04a1f5e6455846258b4f7b0ef9ab2da8
msgid "Case statements"
msgstr "case 语句"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:74 4db6ceeb7b9843948cc643e8195c5d5a
msgid ""
"The case label indentation is acceptable either when lined up with the "
"switch or indented once."
msgstr "case 标签的缩进既可与 switch 对齐，也可再缩进一次，两种方式均可接受。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:117 952369e77861474e93a57705a343ef52
msgid "Spacing"
msgstr "空格使用"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:120 11c39abe0dc14b5d8add3b3288793073
msgid "Unary operators"
msgstr "一元运算符"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:122 f0c1427503f64bc18671bac29099a27a
msgid "Do not place spaces around unary operators."
msgstr "一元运算符两侧不加空格。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:137 ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:260
#: 3978445463ae49a8910397f68aecea22 47441861376141bcb0a72985915f3954
msgid "Control statements"
msgstr "控制语句"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:139 663b72a2c830405198a148dee8d713f0
msgid "Place spaces between control statements and their parentheses."
msgstr "控制语句与括号之间加空格。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:164 6ccf6cf9d32d4218a8387dbec07e9552
msgid "Function calls"
msgstr "函数调用"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:166 de97c0cc41564ce3a1340beca8059eb2
msgid ""
"Do not place spaces between a function and its parentheses, or between a "
"parenthesis and its content."
msgstr "函数与括号之间不加空格，括号与内容之间也不加空格。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:186 83ffbe371e9f4b36809d0a2e515cf247
msgid "Trailing whitespaces"
msgstr "行尾空格"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:188 e2b89572fee747bf8527707d8aa1b222
msgid ""
"Don't leave trailing whitespace on new code (a good editor can manage this "
"for you). Fixing whitespace on existing code should be done as a separate "
"commit (do not include with other changes)."
msgstr "新代码中不要留行尾空格（优秀的编辑器可自动处理）。对现有代码的空格修复应作为独立提交（不得与其他变更混在一起）。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:193 0a45003b1f0f4928b2f904a7cf9216b0
msgid "Line breaks"
msgstr "换行"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:196 8993bd66aa56417ab6d1f22f0ae043a4
msgid "Single statements"
msgstr "单一语句"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:198 f1c4660f1a38490a9926682b601adacc
msgid ""
"Each statement should get its own line except in method implementations in "
"header files which may (or may not be) on a single lines."
msgstr "每条语句单独占一行，但头文件中的方法实现可以写在一行（也可以不这样做）。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:224 669fa2f7dc0442d384e9d25dea71103f
msgid "Else statement"
msgstr "else 语句"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:226 0b437f336273463f8a18529f1017c883
msgid ""
"An ``else`` statement should go on the same line as a preceding close brace."
msgstr "``else`` 语句应与前面的右花括号同行。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:251 69d8285950fd413f9d024d833fa4b034
msgid "Braces"
msgstr "花括号"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:254 14a441fbc5c3406cb8fce6116df5ce9a
msgid "Function braces"
msgstr "函数花括号"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:256 8dae4d27437a40878e456561d4016042
msgid ""
"Functions definitions: place each brace on its own line. For methods inside "
"a header file, braces can be inline."
msgstr "函数定义：每个花括号单独占一行。头文件中的方法，花括号可以内联。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:262 a2b19143addc48fd9b95e0d58f956fe6
msgid ""
"Control statements (``if``, ``while``, ``do``, ``else``) should always use "
"braces around the statements."
msgstr "控制语句（``if``、``while``、``do``、``else``）的语句体必须始终使用花括号。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:285 c8b566689af64d30b65c0f3659c4d407
msgid "Other braces"
msgstr "其他花括号"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:287 11fffbbc06bc45c8859fd54303e8ca87
msgid ""
"Place the open brace on the line preceding the code block; place the close "
"brace on its own line."
msgstr "左花括号放在代码块前一行末尾；右花括号单独占一行。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:316 217bf2741243410ebcfc13abb70aab28
msgid "Names"
msgstr "命名"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:319 4d0d5bfbb6fc4e3eba1c0f6330d45c57
msgid "Private members"
msgstr "私有成员"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:321 71ede30ed2784eafacab99565de87a71
msgid "Private members in classes may be prefixed with an underscore:"
msgstr "类中的私有成员可以加下划线前缀："

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:341 6187db8c60c24e14aa8894420f8996ad
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot codebase contains a mixture of the two styles.  Either is "
"acceptable, with a preference for no-leading-underscores in new code."
msgstr "ArduPilot 代码库中两种风格均有使用，两者均可接受，但新代码倾向于不使用前导下划线。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:344 3d458cd5346e4fecae40fdb40eb1e27e
msgid "Class names"
msgstr "类名"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:346 af8b0c18374648598a3bc3f2631df04e
msgid ""
"Class names should capitalise each word and separate them using underscores."
msgstr "类名应每个单词首字母大写，并用下划线分隔。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:362 b83755389ffb467990b215d33a030800
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:364 462bcb5dff1344eab5fb3ccd6160e9dd
msgid ""
"Prefer enum classes over raw enums. Enums should be PascalCase, and be "
"singular. All entries should have trailing commas, even the last one."
msgstr "优先使用枚举类而非原始枚举。枚举应使用 PascalCase 命名，且应为单数形式。所有条目应有尾部逗号，包括最后一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:387 d1023345ecca46b1a34a82365fa54598
msgid "Functions and variables"
msgstr "函数和变量"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:389 9dc5f944ab2e409eb2dd12bb5879aed3
msgid ""
"Functions that return a single physical value or variables that represent a "
"physical value should be suffixed by the physical unit."
msgstr "返回单一物理量的函数或表示物理量的变量应以物理单位作为后缀。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:405 2f32b48ad3f349438f797e15dee91342
msgid ""
"Functions or variables that represent a value relative to a frame should be "
"suffixed with the frame first, then with the physical unit (if different "
"than SI units). SI suffixes are occasionally used to avoid confusion in "
"modules with similar variables of different units, but only if necessary to "
"avoid confusion."
msgstr ""
"表示相对于某坐标系的值的函数或变量，应先加坐标系后缀，再加物理单位后缀（当单位不是 SI 单位时）。SI "
"后缀有时用于区分模块中单位不同的同类变量，但仅在必要时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:425 0395d63d0a034153859cf02e7f4b6e71
msgid "Preferred Abbreviations for Units"
msgstr "单位的推荐缩写"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:427 a27fa536dfb94f08a0e6873cdefa353f
msgid ""
"Variables that reference units of measure should normally be suffixed so "
"that it's easier to understand the values when reading the code. No suffix "
"is required when a variable is in seconds, meters, or (angular) degrees or "
"degrees-Celsius."
msgstr "引用计量单位的变量通常应加后缀，以便在阅读代码时更容易理解数值含义。当变量以秒、米、（角）度或摄氏度为单位时，不需要后缀。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:430 d45a51d226d344d6901828c7995c2fd5
msgid "Standard name suffixes for Units"
msgstr "单位的标准名称后缀"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:434 37d0d0cdc5664eaba875414c250ab63a
msgid "Measure"
