msgstr "伏特"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:551 65058d5f907f42b88d8d228dbcc5a4f5
msgid "_v"
msgstr "_v"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:556 16264020c7d24a4083ac42843d3ea82b
msgid "Commenting"
msgstr "注释规范"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:558 4f30ef39e7f64bcb8346c9485590bcbb
msgid ""
"Each file, function and method with public visibility should have a comment "
"at the top describing what it does."
msgstr "每个文件、函数和公共可见性方法的顶部应有说明其功能的注释。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:562 34ac5e09ebcb4020972676ade581965d
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:564 54db4c300a3c46afb20e4d4b77be31b3
msgid ""
"Users gather critical information from these fields. With parameters that "
"are well-documented in the code, the wiki and GCS can update parameters "
"automatically. When parameters are properly documented, users can often tune"
" their vehicles without needing pages and posts of external non-linked "
"documentation. While information here is not a substitute for a tuning "
"guide, it can be very effective at guiding users to change the right things."
msgstr ""
"用户从这些字段中获取关键信息。对于在代码中有良好文档的参数，wiki "
"和地面站可以自动更新参数。参数文档完善后，用户通常无需查阅大量外部非链接文档即可调整飞行器。虽然这里的信息不能替代调参指南，但对引导用户做出正确调整非常有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:566 c942991ad5bb4dbaa6246f040030979b
msgid ""
"Parameter with multiple words should have the words ordered from left to "
"right by importance:"
msgstr "多词参数名应按重要性从左到右排列各词："

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:568 36d96953acad436083e9cb394a563715
msgid ""
"the flight mode, feature or sensor should be the first word.  I.e. a "
"parameter relevant only to the RTL flight mode should start with \"RTL\" "
"like \"RTL_ALT\"."
msgstr "飞行模式、功能或传感器应作为第一个词。例如，仅与 RTL 飞行模式相关的参数应以「RTL」开头，如「RTL_ALT」。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:569 6d1d0e09e27c49a4bd0f7589f15383fc
msgid ""
"qualifiers like \"MIN\", \"MAX\" or units (in the rare case they appear in "
"the name) should be on the far right.  I.e RTL_ALT_MIN is better than "
"RTL_MIN_ALT."
msgstr ""
"「MIN」、「MAX」或单位（在极少数情况下出现在名称中）等限定词应放在最右侧。例如，RTL_ALT_MIN 优于 RTL_MIN_ALT。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:571 d88368f0c764409d94db2c6a1816e0e7
msgid ""
"Re-use words from other parameters if possible instead of creating new "
"words.  For example we use \"MIN\" and \"MAX\" so these should be used "
"instead of equivalent words like \"TOP\" and \"BOTTOM\"."
msgstr "尽量复用其他参数中已有的词，而非创造新词。例如，我们使用「MIN」和「MAX」，因此应使用它们而非「TOP」和「BOTTOM」等同义词。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:573 2785b6fc8137429fa72640bfbba4ad6e
msgid ""
"Parameters should be in the standard unit (meters for distances, degrees for"
" angles) but in cases where they are not the unit may (optionally) be "
"appended to the end.  This is definitely not a requirement but is up to the "
"developer."
msgstr "参数应使用标准单位（距离用米，角度用度），但在特殊情况下可选择性地将单位附加到名称末尾。这并非强制要求，由开发者自行决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:575 35df3a7b871c4dcea50c1e59291ad7b9
msgid "The total length of the parameter name must be 16 characters or less."
msgstr "参数名总长度不得超过 16 个字符。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:579 97ae2eed103b4126959db4c7586ba518
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "显示名称"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:581 84f36cba622445689351e741ef5bc364
msgid ""
"The display name is typically a 2-5 word phrase that describes what the "
"parameter changes. Often this is the Parameter Name spelled out in full "
"words. Do not start with nondescriptive word like \"the.\" A good Display "
"Name for PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG is \"Maximum Pitch Angle\"."
msgstr ""
"显示名称通常是 2~5 个单词的短语，描述该参数的变更内容。通常是参数名的完整拼写形式，不要以「the」等无意义词开头。PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG"
" 的一个好的显示名称示例为「Maximum Pitch Angle」。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:585 920630b21d9f41809c7e9c12c9eaa239
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:587 8569ab87da2a4b53815a61fb098783f3
msgid ""
"The description is a long text field for a complete description of the "
"parameter and how changing it may affect vehicle behavior. It should be kept"
" concise while giving the most critical information to the user."
msgstr "描述是一个长文本字段，用于完整说明该参数及其更改可能对飞行器行为产生的影响。应在给出最关键信息的同时保持简洁。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:602 f98e0d12176f4a15bd2fc9ed7fb1fb73
msgid "Avoid in Descriptions:"
msgstr "描述中应避免："

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:604 4611e4f3d4c540f1a1a335fd1f67277e
msgid ""
"Helping words and nondescriptive language such as \"This parameter "
"changes..., you, etc.\" that is common to all parameters"
msgstr "所有参数通用的辅助词和无意义语言，如「This parameter changes...、you 等」"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:605 6c3629c9c9384edca2cf3ddba324375e
msgid "Referencing other parameters unless it is critical"
msgstr "除非非常关键，否则不要引用其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:606 df52767a92914e378952a50a6b0f0d13
msgid "Describing a 0 setting as \"disabled\""
msgstr "将 0 设置描述为「禁用」"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:607 3604f841c6484a7f8d9dc33983eb553e
msgid "Default settings"
msgstr "默认设置"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:609 0ed0e44eb4f14285b66b4368efff9940
msgid "Encourage in Descriptions:"
msgstr "描述中应鼓励："

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:611 3788f389b060468c9cdbf3c36ccc055b
msgid "Present tense language"
msgstr "使用现在时"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:612 82dd7f0a0295449ba119146d016e4820
msgid ""
"Consequences of changing the parameter (this also guides users how to tune "
"for their vehicle)"
msgstr "说明更改参数的影响（这也能指导用户针对其飞行器进行调参）"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:613 d65a3ccfd7b443fcb5085629b4c9bc13
msgid "When the parameter is used or ignored"
msgstr "说明参数何时生效或被忽略"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:614 0018d0653d0f4411a8adb7a5dc32a033
msgid "When a 0 setting uses another parameter for the value"
msgstr "说明 0 值时使用另一参数的情况"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:618 30d4596467604233a79d479a986ad36a
msgid "Value, Unit, Range"
msgstr "值、单位、范围"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:620 3c833b6d047a4d18b6a1b7efe30f6824
msgid ""
"The values, units, ranges, and steps are all critical for adjusting the "
"parameter as well. Include them when possible."
msgstr "值、单位、范围和步长对于调整参数同样至关重要，应尽量提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:624 45d2766adc63498097c96386fa96bca7
msgid "User"
msgstr "用户"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:626 f502ad1e800d456cadd5ca8f8f421cb9
msgid ""
"The user field helps to categorize and hide advanced parameters from being "
"adjusted by new users. There are currently 2 user fields:"
msgstr "用户字段用于对参数进行分类，并对新用户隐藏高级参数。目前有 2 个用户字段："

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:628 ab7d3f168b6c439bafa43d3dfb300b9b
msgid "Standard - Available to anyone"
msgstr "Standard——所有人可用"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:629 4e4c68d5f7ef4fdebcf43c4a44ef5935
msgid "Advanced - Available to advanced users"
msgstr "Advanced——仅高级用户可用"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:632 427c14da71474cac8249522267095bc8
msgid "Floating Point Annotation"
msgstr "浮点数标注"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:634 8b2ef8da5fbc4f0d81483fcc5006ebf5
msgid "ArduPilot is compiled with ``-fsingle-precision-constant``."
msgstr "ArduPilot 使用 ``-fsingle-precision-constant`` 编译。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:636 1aa4750d4d394e5089d62ad342742558
msgid ""
"That means it is currently allowable to leave off the float specifier from "
"constants.  It is also permissable to have them."
msgstr "这意味着常量中可以省略浮点类型说明符，也可以保留。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:638 ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:650
#: 52fa10e280154457a06df28404b6828e 7640cf674ed14cb7bc7fc802987762f5
msgid "**Right**"
msgstr "**正确**"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:646 d88ce7cac686447b81082f66d69645bf
msgid "Multiplication vs Division"
msgstr "乘法与除法"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:648 942b5618371e4f189ebff6bc74883f25
msgid "Use multiplication rather than division where possible:"
msgstr "尽量使用乘法而非除法："

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:656 47fec9ccf7e046c9b145fb75a01c3efb
msgid "**Wrong**"
msgstr "**错误**"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:662 462033e7a00d497fa7699383ca49b185
msgid "Multiplications typically take fewer cycles to compute than divisions."
msgstr "乘法通常比除法需要更少的 CPU 时钟周期。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:666 03927f42a8674a8ab8f0bcadf030d670
msgid "ArduPilot Design Decisions"
msgstr "ArduPilot 设计决策"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:668 206c1d1430494346b641e41a2b98a24e
msgid ""
"Several design decisions have been in the ArduPilot codebase to accommodate "
"its embedded nature which may surprise some programmers."
msgstr "ArduPilot 代码库中有若干为适应其嵌入式特性而做出的设计决策，可能令部分程序员感到意外。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:671 08a85f5fd6e545f187ecb269f7a5f695
msgid "Implicit Zeroing of Memory"
msgstr "隐式内存清零"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:673 cf82614f58f34a99a3d54e912ff007c0
msgid ""
"Implicitly zeroing of memory gives us more consistent (even-if-bad) "
"behaviour, and saves us flash space as most places in the code don't need to"
" initialise the memory they've allocated.  The only memory you MUST zero is "
"stack-stored variables - locals, asprintf and the like."
msgstr ""
"隐式内存清零可提供更一致（即使有时不理想）的行为，并节省 Flash "
"空间，因为代码大多数地方不需要初始化已分配的内存。唯一**必须**清零的内存是栈存储变量——局部变量、asprintf 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:675 2fb7e8435e3e4dffbdb1bbb8632c5924
msgid "new and malloc both zero their memory"
msgstr "new 和 malloc 都会将其内存清零"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:676 e51fb4a4b8a04f80b5e59968971e496a
msgid ""
"bss-stored data does not need to be zeroed (so no members in a singleton "
"object need to be zeroed"
msgstr "bss 段存储的数据无需清零（因此单例对象的成员无需清零）"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:677 9f24b6aae2564dafbd61a31945fb0269
msgid "Vectors are special and zero themelves - even on the stack"
msgstr "向量较为特殊，会自行清零——即使在栈上也是如此"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:678 043a71ba2c714f6e82b01071fecf79b9
msgid ""
"static variables within a function (which we generally frown upon) do not "
"need to be zeroed"
msgstr "函数内的 static 变量（通常不建议使用）无需清零"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:682 57a6a88980a04df6ba34c94516522e61
msgid "Bit fields are generally frowned upon"
msgstr "通常不建议使用位域"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:684 d45d129325f742b0b2972e6d9b796fe1
msgid ""
"Using bit fields reduces RAM usage but can considerably increase flash "
"usage, as to extract a boolean truth value from a bit field requires more "
"machine instructions.  If the variable is frequently accessed then this can "
"be a LOT of flash."
msgstr ""
"使用位域可减少 RAM 占用，但会显著增加 Flash 占用，因为从位域提取布尔值需要更多机器指令。若该变量被频繁访问，Flash 占用可能增加很多。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:686 ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:712
#: 3dbedefc59b348feb341a418d7174f51 63f23e4c2ed640d8b1db3c76eaa5cf30
msgid "**Not preferred:**"
msgstr "**不推荐：**"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:696 ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:723
#: 26a26ff2900e451dbe4e41610d93236f aa4abbd190954d17a439bf419a995411
msgid "**Preferred:**"
msgstr "**推荐：**"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:708 05773f75a39b47f592eaff108fd60ecf
msgid ""
"Initialise member variables in header files rather than in constructors"
msgstr "在头文件中初始化成员变量，而非在构造函数中"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:710 7c02f77c98844d0e875e4b3a182d46f8
msgid ""
"Where a member isn't dependent on a constructor parameter, we prefer to do "
"in-class-definition initialisation."
msgstr "当成员变量不依赖构造函数参数时，优先使用类内定义初始化。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:737 f9ab2a1b1fa74f10bd3e8a88c088f99e
msgid "No Standard Library"
msgstr "不使用标准库"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:739 63d6b97ab83f42bdab0398ec3eca53cb
msgid ""
"For efficiency reasons, ArduPilot doesn't use the C standard library "
"(``std::``).  We also prefer to use functions which are consistent across "
"platforms to ease support (not using 64-bit maths on platforms that support "
"it is useful, for example)."
msgstr ""
"出于效率考虑，ArduPilot 不使用 C 标准库（``std::``）。我们也倾向于使用跨平台一致的函数以简化支持工作（例如，不在支持 64 "
"位数学运算的平台上使用 64 位运算是有意义的）。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:741 13e9877fc886409caf0faa4e3ef283b8
msgid ""
"This means no ``std::vector``, no ``std::string`` and no "
"``std::unordered_map``, for example."
msgstr "这意味着不使用 ``std::vector``、``std::string`` 和 ``std::unordered_map`` 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:743 9a881b59117045c388bca1019b640878
msgid ""
"We try to avoid library calls that handle their own allocations - but if you"
" really want to go that way, including the header to get these isn't "
"sufficient - you will need to fiddle with the build system to link ``std`` "
"in."
msgstr "我们尽量避免调用自行管理内存分配的库函数——但如果您确实需要这样做，仅包含头文件是不够的，还需要修改构建系统以链接 ``std``。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:746 9d12d2bf2e3d4999a32c6ab35052c813
msgid "Alternatives to ``std::vector``"
msgstr "``std::vector`` 的替代方案"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:748 68bddb7ef3c24a03a2aa4e50748dbca0
msgid "Most of the time fixed-length arrays are used."
msgstr "大多数情况下使用固定长度数组。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:750 094cee3b6b7f4e51909a577e2ef2d459
msgid ""
"``AP_ExpandingArray`` may be an option for you - but expanding in-flight "
"might be a bad thing."
msgstr "``AP_ExpandingArray`` 可能是一个选择——但在飞行中动态扩展可能带来问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:752 69fdeab4bd9c46139e904dc8c9342bf8
msgid "Linked lists are used on some places."
msgstr "部分地方使用了链表。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:756 1d77f636c2dc4c239e1114638ce8ecd6
msgid "Alternatives to ``std::string``"
msgstr "``std::string`` 的替代方案"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:758 6b214819a0bb465a9e216174577280a0
msgid ""
"``asprintf`` is used in some places.  Generally simply using ``char*`` is "
"adequate."
msgstr "部分地方使用 ``asprintf``。通常直接使用 ``char*`` 就足够了。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:761 22566ccb8fdc416a8111287ae17c8667
msgid "Alternatives to ``std::unordered_map``"
msgstr "``std::unordered_map`` 的替代方案"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:763 6199a984386e4cc7b1e936e782346a9f
msgid ""
"Create an array of structs and iterate it.  This is done when turning a "
"mavlink id into an ap_message id, for example."
msgstr "创建一个结构体数组并遍历它。例如，将 mavlink id 转换为 ap_message id 时就采用此方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:765 24242f90953540449ab7e67bb269086a
msgid "Create an ordered array of structs and bisect-search it."
msgstr "创建一个有序结构体数组并进行二分查找。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:767 b3eeb91c14454dea93e97a42015d131e
msgid "Create an array of structs with a perfect hash."
msgstr "创建一个使用完美哈希的结构体数组。"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:770 ce26f040a4dd4fc1ae07fa6980b4e12c
msgid "No Dead Code"
msgstr "不保留死代码"

#: ../../source/docs/style-guide.rst:772 a8c6b4bf92e242fd841677fb0954b0e5
msgid ""
"We don't keep dead code in ArduPilot.  If code is unused, it should be "
"removed - not just commented out.  This is a general rule and not "
"universally adhered to."
msgstr "ArduPilot 不保留死代码。未使用的代码应直接删除，而非仅注释掉。这是一条通用规则，但并非所有地方都严格遵守。"
